 CBLogin args;MSG;msgmode;ctl;t;user;pwd;error;i;SALT;HASH;z;h;s
 ⍝ Handle "Login" and "Forgot Password" buttons on Login form

 ctl←⊃⌽'.'(≠⊆⊢)⊃args
 MSG←''
 msgmode←'Error'

 t←{'F1.INPUT.CREDS.',⍵,'.C'}¨'USERID' 'PWD' ⍝ Full names of controls
 (user pwd)←t eWG¨⊂'Text'                    ⍝ /// Someday try F1.INPUT.CREDS.(USERID PWD).C.Text
 error←T 'Forkert bruger eller passord'
 i←USERS.(⎕C UserId)⍳⊂⎕C user                ⍝ Find the user?
 :Hold 'USERS.Login'                         ⍝ Just in case maintenance happens at the same time
     →(i>≢USERS.UserId)⍴ERROR
     (USERID NAME ADMIN)←i⊃¨USERS.(UserId Name Admin)
 :EndHold

 ID←(MEMBERS.Mail⍳⍥⎕C⊂USERID)⊃MEMBERS.ID,⊂'' ⍝ The USERID we log in with is the Mail address, translate to initials

 :Select ctl
 :Case 'LOGIN'
     →(0≠≢error←ValidatePassword i pwd)⍴ERROR
     ⍝ /// Only Admins should be able to link to sensitive documents
     ⍝ /// This logic is broken in a multi-user system - we need conditional access to folders
     ADMIN←∨/'1yY'∊ADMIN
     #.EWC.WSS.Aliases←(1 1,ADMIN)⌿{⍵(ROOT,'/',⍵)}¨'Resources' 'Documents' 'Data'
     z←#.EWC.WSS.CheckAliases

     2 eNQ'F1' 'SetCookie'('OWUMUSER=',USERID) ⍝ Remember user name until next time
     MakeMain                                ⍝ Bring up the main form

 :Case 'FORGOT'
     z←user DisplayPopup'Login' 'Klik OK for at få sendt et nyt passord til %1.' 'Query'('OK' 'Cancel')
     :If 1=z
         z←{⍵[?8⍴≢⍵]}'?!@&',⎕D,⎕A,⎕C ⎕A ⍝ Generate random password
         SetPassword i z
         z←z T 'Dit nye passord er %1.'
         :If 0≠⊃z←SendMessage user'Nyt passord'z ⍬
             →ERROR⊣error←2⊃z
         :EndIf
         z←DisplayPopup'Login' 'Check din indbakke og prøv at logge ind igen. Husk at du kan skifte passord når du er logget ind.' 'Info' 'OK'
     :EndIf
 :Else
     →ERROR⊣error←'Intern fejl - kan ikke logge ind.'
 :EndSelect
 →0

ERROR:
 DisplayPopup'Login'error msgmode'OK'
